      "title": "GMR Energy Limited acquired an additional 2.37% stake in GMR Kamalanga Energy Limited from IDFC First Bank Limited (BSE:539437) for INR 600 million.",
      "body": "GMR Energy Limited acquired an additional 2.37% stake in GMR Kamalanga Energy Limited from IDFC First Bank Limited (BSE:539437) for INR 600 million on March 30, 2026. A cash consideration of INR 600 million will be paid by GMR Energy Limited. As part of consideration, INR 600 million is paid towards common equity of GMR Kamalanga Energy Limited.\n\nFor the period ending March 31, 2025, GMR Kamalanga Energy Limited reported total revenue of INR 30.17 billion.\n\nGMR Energy Limited completed the acquisition of an additional 2.37% stake in GMR Kamalanga Energy Limited from IDFC First Bank Limited (BSE:539437) on March 30, 2026.",
