      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.54 (up from ₹0.46 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹62.2b (up 16% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹4.79b (up 41% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 7.7% (up from 6.4% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 26% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 2.9% growth forecast for the Banks industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 28% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 12% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
